Janaka's envoys reach Ayōdhyā after three nights --- Envoys enter palace and behold aged Daśaratha --- Envoys convey Janaka's greetings with priests and teachers --- Envoys recall valor-price vow and baffled kings --- Envoys report Rāma broke divine bow in assembly --- Envoys invite Daśaratha with priests for Sītā wedding --- Daśaratha consults Vasiṣṭha, Vāmadēva and ministers --- Ministers agree and Daśaratha orders march tomorrow